{
  "name": "Transcribe recordings into HubSpot call notes with FonadaLabs",
  "description": "Receive audio_url, language and contact_email, transcribe with the customer's FonadaLabs connection, draft a call note with an AI step, and attach it to the HubSpot contact with that email. Choose the AI model and connect FonadaLabs and HubSpot before publishing. The contact is looked up first; if none matches, the run stops before any paid step.",
  "flows": [
    {
      "displayName": "Recording to HubSpot call note",
      "schemaVersion": "28",
      "valid": false,
      "trigger": {
        "name": "trigger",
        "lastUpdatedDate": "2026-11-20T00:00:00.000Z",
        "displayName": "Receive recording",
        "type": "PIECE_TRIGGER",
        "valid": true,
        "settings": {
          "pieceName": "@activepieces/piece-webhook",
          "pieceVersion": "0.1.43",
          "input": {
            "authType": "none",
            "authFields": {}
          },
          "propertySettings": {},
          "triggerName": "catch_webhook"
        },
        "nextAction": {
          "name": "step_1",
          "lastUpdatedDate": "2026-11-20T00:00:00.000Z",
          "displayName": "Find contact by email",
          "type": "PIECE",
          "valid": false,
          "settings": {
            "pieceName": "@activepieces/piece-hubspot",
            "pieceVersion": "0.14.0",
            "input": {
              "firstSearchPropertyName": "email",
              "firstSearchPropertyValue": "{{trigger['output'].body.contact_email}}"
            },
            "propertySettings": {},
            "actionName": "find-contact",
            "errorHandlingOptions": {
              "retryOnFailure": {
                "value": false
              },
              "continueOnFailure": {
                "value": false
              }
            }
          },
          "nextAction": {
            "name": "step_2",
            "displayName": "Contact found?",
            "type": "ROUTER",
            "valid": true,
            "lastUpdatedDate": "2026-11-20T00:00:00.000Z",
            "settings": {
              "executionType": "EXECUTE_FIRST_MATCH",
              "branches": [
                {
                  "branchName": "Contact found",
                  "branchType": "CONDITION",
                  "conditions": [
                    [
                      {
                        "firstValue": "{{step_1['output'].total}}",
                        "secondValue": "0",
                        "operator": "NUMBER_IS_GREATER_THAN"
                      }
                    ]
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "branchName": "No contact: stop before paid steps",
                  "branchType": "FALLBACK"
                }
              ]
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "name": "step_3",
                "lastUpdatedDate": "2026-11-20T00:00:00.000Z",
                "displayName": "Transcribe recording",
                "type": "PIECE",
                "valid": false,
                "settings": {
                  "pieceName": "@activepieces/piece-fonadalabs",
                  "pieceVersion": "0.2.0",
                  "input": {
                    "audioUrl": "{{trigger['output'].body.audio_url}}",
                    "language": "{{trigger['output'].body.language}}",
                    "recoverUpstream": true
                  },
                  "propertySettings": {},
                  "actionName": "transcribe_audio",
                  "errorHandlingOptions": {
                    "retryOnFailure": {
                      "value": false
                    },
                    "continueOnFailure": {
                      "value": false
                    }
                  }
                },
                "nextAction": {
                  "name": "step_4",
                  "lastUpdatedDate": "2026-11-20T00:00:00.000Z",
                  "displayName": "Draft from transcript",
                  "type": "PIECE",
                  "valid": false,
                  "settings": {
                    "pieceName": "@activepieces/piece-ai",
                    "pieceVersion": "0.16.0",
                    "input": {
                      "prompt": "Write a CRM call note from the transcript below. Use only what the transcript states.\n\nSummary: 2 to 4 sentences.\nDecisions: bullet list, or 'Not stated'.\nAction items: bullet list; name an owner or due date only if the speaker said one, otherwise 'Not stated'.\nDo not invent names, dates, amounts, commitments or sentiment.\n\nTranscript:\n{{step_3['output'].text}}",
                      "maxOutputTokens": 4000
                    },
                    "propertySettings": {},
                    "actionName": "askAi",
                    "errorHandlingOptions": {
                      "retryOnFailure": {
                        "value": false
                      },
                      "continueOnFailure": {
                        "value": false
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "nextAction": {
                    "name": "step_5",
                    "lastUpdatedDate": "2026-11-20T00:00:00.000Z",
                    "displayName": "Attach call note",
                    "type": "PIECE",
                    "valid": false,
                    "settings": {
                      "pieceName": "@activepieces/piece-hubspot",
                      "pieceVersion": "0.14.0",
                      "input": {
                        "noteBody": "{{step_4['output']}}",
                        "associatedObjectType": "contact",
                        "associatedObjectId": "{{step_1['output'].results[0].id}}"
                      },
                      "propertySettings": {},
                      "actionName": "create_note",
                      "errorHandlingOptions": {
                        "retryOnFailure": {
                          "value": false
                        },
                        "continueOnFailure": {
                          "value": false
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              null
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": "fonadalabs-setup-audio-to-crm-hubspot",
          "content": "### Setup\n1. **Find contact by email** and **Attach call note:** select your HubSpot connection.\n2. **Transcribe recording:** select your FonadaLabs connection.\n3. **Draft from transcript:** choose an AI model. The transcript is also sent to that AI provider.\n4. Publish, then send JSON to the webhook URL:\n```json\n{\"audio_url\": \"https://.../call.mp3\", \"language\": \"en\", \"contact_email\": \"jane@example.com\"}\n```\nIf no HubSpot contact has that email, **Contact found?** stops the run before any paid step. Create the contact, then re-send.\n\n**Long recordings (over ~8 min):** set the host variable `AP_FLOW_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=3600` and the FonadaLabs step's **Action time budget** to `3300`.\n\nAudio is processed in the FonadaLabs cloud. Recordings above 24 MB must be MP3 or WAV.",
          "ownerId": null,
          "color": "yellow",
          "position": {
            "x": -520,
            "y": 0
          },
          "size": {
            "width": 440,
            "height": 520
          },
          "createdAt": "2026-11-20T00:00:00.000Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-11-20T00:00:00.000Z"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
